  "concept": "共行信号时刻表 (Co-Mobility Signal Daily Timetable)",
  "concept_note_zh": "v5 闭塞区间表是静态的'全时段同一规则'；时刻表把它推演为时段×区间的运行模式矩阵。信号管安全（谁可进入），时刻表管时间（何时开放）——铁路运行图与信号系统一体两面。",
  "concept_note_en": "The v5 block table is static ('same rule all day'); the timetable projects it into a period x block mode matrix. Signaling governs safety (who may enter); the timetable governs time (when) — a railway working diagram and its signaling are two faces of one system.",
  "grammar_dependency": "visual/assets/signaling-grammar.json (v9 rule completion applied)",
